=== RISKS ===
- HTTP listener port defaults 8080 (occupied on this host); ops must set HTTP_INGRESS_PORT. Bind failure is
  fail-safe (MQTT loop continues) but silent-ish (single error log) — watch for it in prod logs.
- Credential lookup is per-request psycopg2 (no cache/TTL) — fine at webhook rates, not for high-frequency polling.
- No rate limiting on /ingest (explicit Phase-3 scope); exposed port must sit behind firewall/auth proxy in prod.
